  "description": "GeoRSCLIP is a domain-adapted vision-language model for remote sensing, based on CLIP and fine-tuned on the large-scale RS5M remote sensing image-text paired dataset. It leverages parameter-efficient fine-tuning (PEFT) methods and full fine-tuning to bridge the gap between general vision-language models and remote sensing downstream tasks.",
